# Origin of the Iron-Spyder FastAPI surface (spy_der/app/api.py).
#
# Leave UNSET to run against the built-in synthetic generator — the UI labels
# itself "Synthetic data" and every number is fabricated.
#
# Public dashboard (this project only): https://iron-spyder.vercel.app
# Do NOT point browsers or bookmarks at spy-der.vercel.app (legacy) or at the
# VPS Hostinger hostname — that hostname is server-only for the BFF.
#
# The engine binds 127.0.0.1 on the VPS by design. Point SPYDER_API_BASE at the
# Caddy edge (TLS + bearer token). Example Hostinger hostname:
#
# SPYDER_API_BASE=https://srv1874660.hstgr.cloud
# SPYDER_API_TOKEN=<same value as on the VPS>
